1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,059
Two patches.

2
00:00:01,059 --> 00:00:01,919
Same total.

3
00:00:01,919 --> 00:00:03,208
One is wrong.

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:11,059
Meet Nora, a quantum research software engineer.

5
00:00:11,059 --> 00:00:14,736
Her job is to accept a repair without changing

6
00:00:14,736 --> 00:00:16,370
what the evidence supports.

7
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:20,536
In the real interface, I choose a sample and

8
00:00:20,536 --> 00:00:22,018
run its local review.

9
00:00:22,018 --> 00:00:24,613
The valid repair matches all four pairs.

10
00:00:24,613 --> 00:00:27,208
Now I select the deliberately wrong control.

11
00:00:27,208 --> 00:00:30,543
Its total is still two point six zero, but

12
00:00:30,543 --> 00:00:32,026
the verifier rejects it.

13
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:42,486
The individual correlations tell a different story.

14
00:00:42,486 --> 00:00:45,771
A matching total hides conflicting pair values.

15
00:00:45,771 --> 00:00:49,526
LabRepair shows the difference that changes the decision.

16
00:00:49,526 --> 00:00:52,342
These local samples use synthetic data.

17
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:57,116
For the recorded model step, NVIDIA Nemotron ran on

18
00:00:57,116 --> 00:00:58,421
Nebius Token Factory.

19
00:00:58,421 --> 00:01:01,032
Our prompt supplied the channel convention.

20
00:01:01,032 --> 00:01:04,948
The model translated it into typed parameters; it did

21
00:01:04,948 --> 00:01:06,689
not discover the correction.

22
00:01:06,689 --> 00:01:10,605
A deterministic adapter built the patch, keeping the counts

23
00:01:10,605 --> 00:01:11,910
and tests protected.

24
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:21,364
A real Nebius Sandbox operation tested three source variants.

25
00:01:21,364 --> 00:01:23,678
Baseline: two of four checks.

26
00:01:23,678 --> 00:01:25,992
Model repair: four of four.

27
00:01:25,992 --> 00:01:28,768
Wrong-pair control: three of four, rejected.

28
00:01:28,768 --> 00:01:32,932
The recorded operation took one point two seven three

29
00:01:32,932 --> 00:01:35,246
seconds, with guest networking disabled.

30
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:39,473
The repair passes at two point six zero.

31
00:01:39,473 --> 00:01:43,565
The original three point four zero claim remains not reproduced.

32
00:01:43,565 --> 00:01:45,202
Those are separate decisions.

33
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:49,579
For incomplete evidence, the interface asks for review.

34
00:01:49,579 --> 00:01:52,536
It does not invent the missing value.

35
00:01:52,536 --> 00:01:56,759
This is a local uncertainty control, not another cloud execution.

36
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:03,468
Nora records a hold against the reviewed source.

37
00:02:03,468 --> 00:02:07,145
The evidence receipt preserves the checks and her intent.

38
00:02:07,145 --> 00:02:09,596
Recording intent launches no new job.

39
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:12,661
LabRepair.

40
00:02:12,661 --> 00:02:14,045
Repair the analysis.

41
00:02:14,045 --> 00:02:15,429
Preserve the evidence.

42
00:02:15,429 --> 00:02:19,120
A passing repair is not a reproduced result.
